/*
 * Declares the MapIteratorKeyAccessValue class.
 *
 * MapIteratorKeyAccessValue represents an operation that retrieves the key currently
 * pointed to by a map iterator. The iterator must refer to a valid entry; the
 * behavior is undefined if the iterator is at the end position.
 *
 * This operator is used internally by map iteration constructs to expose the
 * key associated with the current iterator position.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::map::iteration::key
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/map/iteration/key.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2024-11-15
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
